    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In July 2025, Lilian Kabahweza, a teacher educator from Nakaseke Core Teachers College in Central Uganda, walked through the historic gates of the University of Cambridge. It was her first time as an international student, and the feeling was surreal - stepping into a world where centuries of learning meet the future of innovation.",
